title: Authorizations › New case › Review and sign › After sending
route: /dashboard?request=R-1701, then /authorizations/new/:draftId and /manager
intro: What changes once the request is signed and sent: the Dashboard shows it, the draft's own address turns into a 'was sent' page, and Case Manager stops listing it under Being prepared.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "The request is signed and sent"

group gDash "Dashboard"
  screen sDash "Dashboard\nThe request is open in the side drawer\nChip 'Received', held by Navigator"
  process pCount "In the stage strip 'Received' goes up by one\nA brand-new case was never counted under 'Preparing'"
  toast tToast "Toast: 'Sent to the payer'\nBell notification: 'Sent to the payer'"
endgroup
goto gOpen "Continues in: Dashboard › Open a request"

group gWas "The draft's own address"
  click cBr "Press the browser's Back button, or reopen the case's address"
  screen sWas "R-1701 was sent\n'It was signed and sent to the payer. The agents are following it from the Dashboard.'"
  process pNoSign "'This case is no longer being prepared'\n'Nothing more is needed here.'\nIt cannot be signed a second time"
  click cOpenDash "Click 'Open it on the Dashboard'"
  click cBackCM "Click 'Back to Case Manager'"
endgroup

group gCM "Case Manager › Active cases"
  screen sCM "Case Manager\n'56 active cases.' and 'N are still being prepared.'"
  process pGone "The case leaves the 'Being prepared' card\nThe 'still being prepared' count goes down by one"
  process pBadge "The sidebar badge on 'Case Manager' no longer counts it"
  click cSent "Click the 'N sent today' button"
  process pSentN "The count is one higher (4 becomes 5)"
  process pLedger "The table of active cases gains no row\nThe header still says '56 active cases.'"
endgroup
goto gDash2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Stage strip and requests"
goto gCM2 "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases"

s1 --> sDash --> pCount
sDash --> tToast
sDash --> gOpen
s1 --> cBr --> sWas --> pNoSign
pNoSign --> cOpenDash --> sDash
pNoSign --> cBackCM --> sCM
s1 --> sCM --> pGone --> pBadge
sCM --> cSent --> pSentN --> gDash2
sCM --> pLedger
pLedger -.-> gCM2
